	<string name="device_integrity_title">This phone\'s OS may not be verified</string>
	<string name="device_integrity_bootloader_unlocked">The bootloader is unlocked, so the OS is not verified when the phone starts. Anyone with the phone in hand can install a modified OS that reads your keys, without erasing anything. Relock the bootloader before you put keys on this phone.</string>
	<string name="device_integrity_boot_red">The OS reports that verified boot failed. The installed OS does not match its signature.</string>
	<string name="device_integrity_su_found">Found a root binary at %1$s. Any app that is granted root can read Zigner\'s memory, including decrypted seeds while you sign.</string>
