	<string name="device_integrity_self_reported_note">These results come from the OS itself. A compromised OS can report anything, so a clean result here is not proof the phone is safe. To check the OS without trusting this phone, use hardware attestation from a second device, such as the GrapheneOS Auditor app.</string>
